  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0-preview.2: internal cleanup. Barcode128Options and Barcode2of5Options merged into a single Barcode1DOptions type; FieldDefinition keeps three separate instances for state isolation between ^BC / ^B2 / simple-1D commands within a label. PdfZpl now dispatches 1D barcode commands from a OneDBarcodes table instead of nine individual methods; FieldDefinition's draw-time dispatch is two BarcodeMode -> (Writer, format) dictionaries. DrawFilledRect helper consolidated between PdfZpl and FieldDefinition. SetLocation / SetLocationBottom (^FO / ^FT) share their body. No public-API breakage relative to preview.1; all baselines render byte-identical.",
